    {
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 27 },
      "id": 103,
      "panels": [],
      "title": "Reference",
      "type": "row"
    },
    {
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 7, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 28 },
      "id": 9,
      "options": {
        "code": { "language": "markdown", "showLineNumbers": false, "showMiniMap": false },
        "content": "## Metric catalog (VolutaDiagnostics)\n\n| OTel name | Prometheus (typical) | Kind | Unit |\n|-----------|----------------------|------|------|\n| `voluta.superstep.duration` | `voluta_superstep_duration_milliseconds` | histogram | ms |\n| `voluta.node.duration` | `voluta_node_duration_milliseconds` | histogram | ms |\n| `voluta.interrupt.count` | `voluta_interrupt_count_total` | counter | {interrupt} |\n| `voluta.checkpoint.put.count` | `voluta_checkpoint_put_count_total` | counter | {operation} |\n| `voluta.checkpoint.get.count` | `voluta_checkpoint_get_count_total` | counter | {operation} |\n| `voluta.checkpoint.list.count` | `voluta_checkpoint_list_count_total` | counter | {operation} |\n| `voluta.stream.dropped` | `voluta_stream_dropped_total` | counter | {event} |\n\n**Tags → labels:** `node.name` → `node_name`, `stream.kind` → `stream_kind`, `provider.name` → `provider_name`, `run.status` → `run_status`.\n\nSource of truth: `src/Voluta/Diagnostics/VolutaDiagnostics.cs` · docs: `docs/0.x/concepts/observability.mdx` · import notes: `deploy/grafana/README.md`.",
        "mode": "markdown"
      },
      "title": "Metric names",
      "type": "text"
    }
